# Code Ownership Configuration
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Core Framework
/core/ @maintainers
/src/quantum/ @quantum-team
/src/core/ @core-team

# Testing
/tests/ @qa-team
**/test_*.py @qa-team

# Documentation
/docs/ @docs-team
*.md @docs-team

# CI/CD
/.github/workflows/ @devops-team
*.yml @devops-team

# Configuration
/config/ @devops-team
pyproject.toml @maintainers
requirements*.txt @maintainers
setup.py @maintainers

# Examples
/examples/ @examples-team
*_example.py @examples-team

# Scripts
*.sh @devops-team
*.bat @devops-team

# Web Assets
/web/ @frontend-team
*.html @frontend-team
*.js @frontend-team
*.css @frontend-team

# TypeScript
*.ts @frontend-team
*.tsx @frontend-team

# Rust components
*.rs @systems-team

# Notebooks
*.ipynb @research-team

# Default reviewers for all other files
* @maintainers
